WEBVTT

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:20.160
But you're friends! Why?!

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:22.620
How come?

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:25.250
You really never change, do you?

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:29.860
This is goodbye, Haruka.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:33.650
No!

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:36.160
Isami!

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:48.590
Baron.

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:56.340
Karasu.

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:07.930
You're as sloppy as ever.

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:13.950
It's only slight, but I can sense you.

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:15.010
You're by the sea.

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:34.630
What are you planning to do
by boosting your Reizu undulation?

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:38.280
I guess I'm in no position
to talk about other people.

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:39.760
For Karasu?

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:41.710
Maybe.

00:01:41.710 --> 00:01:43.970
If you're going to fight him,
make sure you kill him.

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:47.980
I can never forgive him!

00:01:47.980 --> 00:01:51.310
He betrayed his comrades without
a thought! He deserves death!

00:01:51.650 --> 00:01:53.340
I never knew...

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:56.400
...that you were so passionate
about camaraderie.

00:01:57.960 --> 00:02:00.300
You aren't planning to let him
get away with it, I hope.

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:03.230
If you can't trust me...

00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:05.040
do you wanna kill him?

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:09.250
Killing that bastard
would be fine by me!

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:11.490
I'll tear him apart with my bare hands!

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:13.530
All right.

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:15.870
Geez.

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:18.770
So you like him that much, huh?

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:23.280
Wh... What are you...?

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:24.580
I don't!

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:26.020
I don't, I don't, I don't!

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:27.820
I don't!

00:02:27.820 --> 00:02:30.010
It's all right, Kosagi.

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:34.020
I...

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:39.030
Fukuro...

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:42.930
I will settle it with Karasu!
He wants it that way too.

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:47.770
Do not get in our way.

00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:42.710
The cherry blossoms were blooming
the last time we met.

00:04:43.150 --> 00:04:45.160
Uh-huh. A present?

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:48.520
No, that's okay.
I'm happy just to see you, Dad.

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:52.890
What's wrong, Haruka?
You sound like you're a little down.

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:55.160
Well...

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:58.570
If someone's about to have
a fight with their best friend...

00:04:58.570 --> 00:05:00.060
what should they do?

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:01.970
You mean yourself?

00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:05.050
It's not me,
I'm talking about two boys.

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:07.510
A boy's fight, huh?

00:05:07.510 --> 00:05:11.950
All they need is a good fist fight.
Then they can patch things up.

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:14.550
No! They can't do that!

00:05:14.550 --> 00:05:15.930
That's absolutely out of the question.

00:05:18.060 --> 00:05:20.790
I guess you really
are a girl sometimes.

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:22.670
It was just an example, that's all.

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:25.130
Oops... Work's come in.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:26.900
Haruka, I'll call you again.

00:05:26.900 --> 00:05:31.200
Okay, got it. I'm looking
forward to next week, Dad.

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:32.600
Bye now.

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:40.040
Yuu, maybe I should go to
middle school in Tokyo too.

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:41.910
Wha?! Why?

00:05:41.910 --> 00:05:45.530
After all, if I'm gonna play soccer,
it'd be better to play in Tokyo.

00:05:46.020 --> 00:05:48.120
But when I talked
to my brother about it...

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:50.720
he gave me the elbow
out of nowhere.

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:53.210
He said, "Where would we get the money?!"

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:56.230
Isami, if you're gonna play soccer,
you're better off going to Italy.

00:05:56.230 --> 00:05:56.570
Huh?

00:05:56.570 --> 00:05:59.330
Wait, that's not right. Is it Spain?

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:01.730
England?

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:04.720
Hey, don't be impossible.
That's not what I meant anyway.

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:11.760
I know.

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:12.240
Huh?

00:06:12.240 --> 00:06:14.140
You're saying it's pointless
for me to take the exams...

00:06:14.610 --> 00:06:17.180
when I don't even have
any dreams or goals, right?

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:19.140
I never said anything like that!

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:22.520
You're lucky because
you found something to do.

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:25.170
I've got nothing.

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:29.160
So why can't my goal be to
get accepted by the school?

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:30.250
Yuu...

00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:32.370
Yuu!

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:33.900
Fujiwara!

00:06:38.270 --> 00:06:41.010
I'm glad I found you both together.

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:42.270
What's wrong, Kaminogi?

00:06:42.270 --> 00:06:43.270
Have you seen Karasu?

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:45.610
Karasu? Haven't seen him.

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:46.590
He's not in the house.

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:47.280
What?

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:49.550
He hasn't been home since yesterday...

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:52.880
and I think something is about to happen...

00:06:52.880 --> 00:06:54.680
so would you help me look for him?

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:57.700
You can't look for someone
if you have no idea where they went.

00:06:58.220 --> 00:07:00.520
If you're that anxious
about him being gone...

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:01.930
why don't you wait
for him quietly at home.

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:03.690
Hey...

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:05.440
You're right.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:07.900
I'm going to look for him a little more.

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:10.500
Kaminogi! Hey, Yuu!

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:14.930
That's no way to talk to her! Hey, Yuu?!

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:18.060
Yeesh...

00:07:44.970 --> 00:07:46.330
What took you so long?

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:51.240
Get up.

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:25.870
Dammit, I guess
I underestimated you a bit.

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:30.970
But this will be our last playtime.

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:33.200
Eh, Karasu?!

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:53.800
Pretty good, Karasu!

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:55.160
Fukuro!

00:10:15.490 --> 00:10:16.720
Karasu...

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:21.950
Hey, you wanna come over again tonight?

00:10:24.730 --> 00:10:27.260
Hey, what are you going
to get as a souvenir?

00:10:27.260 --> 00:10:28.120
Go with the usual stuff.

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:28.520
What?
Go with the usual stuff.

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:31.490
Don't you think that's a little lame?

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:36.530
No...

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:01.830
Where is this?

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:15.380
Haruka, are you still asleep?

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:17.550
You'd better get up
or you'll be late for school.

00:11:17.550 --> 00:11:19.210
Dad?

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:26.550
So, did you get in contact
with your dad?

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:27.890
Yuu...

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:29.860
Was he out?

00:11:29.860 --> 00:11:33.420
Or did he say something to you
about running away from home?

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:37.360
What am I doing here?

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:43.070
That is a phantom dimension
that you did not choose.

00:11:44.210 --> 00:11:46.010
Who are you?

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:49.380
Me? I am a time drifter.

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:54.220
There are infinite dimensions
in existence...

00:11:54.220 --> 00:11:57.230
and an infinite number of yourself
also in existence.

00:11:58.090 --> 00:12:02.390
In the midst of it all, only you
have the power to see the dimensions.

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:06.460
And by you looking at them...

00:12:06.460 --> 00:12:10.410
they are finalized and become your reality.

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:14.420
Wait... They became reality
because I saw them?

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:17.920
Then that was...

00:12:19.440 --> 00:12:21.600
Fukuro... Fukuro...

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:24.340
Will that also become reality?

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:28.040
Because I saw it?

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:33.620
If you know something,
please tell me!

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:34.770
Answer me!

00:12:44.640 --> 00:12:46.500
I have to...

00:13:37.690 --> 00:13:39.330
What is this?

00:13:39.690 --> 00:13:43.060
It's vibrating.
The dimension is wavering.

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:45.960
This is interesting.

00:13:45.960 --> 00:13:47.330
Atori!

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:48.860
It's him.

00:13:48.860 --> 00:13:51.490
I can hear his screams.

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:55.410
Who, Karasu?!

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:57.370
No, Fukuro.

00:13:57.370 --> 00:13:59.860
I won't let him take away my fun.

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:00.700
Atori!

00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:10.720
I heard from Fujiwara.
Karasu went missing?

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:12.620
So, have you found him?

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:14.660
No, I still can't find him!

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:16.960
Oh. It sounds kind of bad, huh.

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:17.730
Uh-huh.

00:14:17.730 --> 00:14:21.190
Listen, I also saw
a man in a black cape.

00:14:21.730 --> 00:14:22.730
Black cape?

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:25.500
We'll help you look for Karasu.
Where are you now?

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:26.700
I'm near the harbor.

00:14:27.240 --> 00:14:29.610
Okay, then we'll search the mountain.

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:30.940
What? But...

00:14:30.940 --> 00:14:33.340
We're friends, aren't we?
Of course we're gonna help you!

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:37.550
All right, let's search near Yayoizaka.

00:14:37.550 --> 00:14:38.450
Hold that thought.

00:14:39.050 --> 00:14:40.230
I'm calling Goto!

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:41.120
But he's totally...

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:43.450
I'm calling him! If he starts
complaining, I'll kick his ass!

00:14:58.070 --> 00:14:59.480
Hey, there.

00:15:00.470 --> 00:15:02.480
Need a lift, young lady?

00:15:05.740 --> 00:15:07.780
This is my car.

00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:09.770
I forgot to return your keys.

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:15.180
Why did you follow me here?

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:18.500
Because I kinda like this place, I guess.

00:15:21.220 --> 00:15:23.490
I'm not here on
Absolute Critical Prevention...

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:25.800
Strategic Committee
business this time, you know.

00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:27.510
Well I took my vacation time.

00:15:28.300 --> 00:15:32.800
Remember how you said that
if there's a me that rolled a 1...

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:35.510
then there's also a me
that rolled a 6 somewhere?

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:39.800
If that's true, I'm curious to find out
how, me, who rolled the 6 is doing.

00:15:42.050 --> 00:15:43.810
Or something like that.

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:48.350
Don't blame me if the guy
who rolled a 6 went bust.

00:15:48.350 --> 00:15:51.660
I'll be fine. I'll go to
a loan shark for cash.

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:53.560
Would you like me to loan you some?

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:00.760
What's the matter, Karasu?
That's all you've got?!

00:16:02.200 --> 00:16:05.660
Get up, Karasu! This is nothing
compared to what Haruka suffered!

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:08.830
You are making her death meaningless!

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:13.220
Why can't you understand
that this dimension
is an illusion to us?!

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:15.510
Snap out of it, Yuu!

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:23.620
All the Harukas from every dimension
are linked to our Haruka.

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:27.520
That's why...

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:30.740
I will protect the Haruka
of this dimension.

00:16:31.160 --> 00:16:33.740
For as long as I live.

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:43.510
Don't worry.

00:16:43.510 --> 00:16:45.500
I won't do anything, so have a seat.

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:53.120
Where's your friend?

00:16:53.120 --> 00:16:56.380
You mean Atori? I don't know either.

00:16:56.890 --> 00:16:58.990
You're from the future too, right?

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:01.150
Yeah, from your perspective.

00:17:02.530 --> 00:17:04.150
Then you're just like him.

00:17:06.230 --> 00:17:07.820
Are you worried about Karasu?

00:17:08.300 --> 00:17:11.840
Not really. It has
nothing to do with me.

00:17:30.350 --> 00:17:31.720
Karasu?!

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:34.590
You're pretty tough.

00:17:34.590 --> 00:17:36.530
Wh-Who, me?

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:39.190
You should be afraid of me,
but you're standing your ground.

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:43.050
I guess Karasu is Karasu
even in other dimensions.

00:17:43.930 --> 00:17:47.770
I'm really hopeless.
I can't take any more of this.

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:51.290
That bastard...

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:55.840
How can he fight this hard?

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:58.910
Does he believe in
this dimension that strongly?

00:18:00.280 --> 00:18:02.410
If you're right about what you said...

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:11.230
Fukuro!

00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:15.560
Karasu!

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:29.520
Time has stopped!

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:33.500
This power is amazing.
It's the Dragon Torque!

00:18:37.490 --> 00:18:39.030
Stop it!

00:18:47.300 --> 00:18:48.100
Karasu!

00:18:49.830 --> 00:18:52.340
Why are you fighting?!
Aren't you friends?!

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:55.340
In the future and in
all the different worlds...

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:58.330
...you both are friends!

00:19:00.010 --> 00:19:04.580
The future Ai was still my friend.

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:06.700
Haruka...

00:19:08.590 --> 00:19:09.920
Haruka...

00:19:26.870 --> 00:19:28.600
I feel good.

00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:33.010
Atori...

00:19:33.010 --> 00:19:35.190
You've started the de-coherence!

00:19:37.050 --> 00:19:37.920
You can't...

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:42.430
You two can die together!

00:19:57.440 --> 00:19:58.730
I took it full-on.

00:20:00.110 --> 00:20:01.420
This is impossible.

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:07.180
You ain't going nowhere.

00:20:09.920 --> 00:20:11.110
Die!

00:20:21.630 --> 00:20:23.240
Hey, I'm over here.

00:20:30.140 --> 00:20:30.800
Disappear.

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:41.420
Karasu!

00:20:42.150 --> 00:20:43.630
Fukuro, he's coming!

00:20:44.150 --> 00:20:45.890
I know.

00:20:46.920 --> 00:20:48.680
Karasu!

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:02.150
He vanished.

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:07.130
Atori's been vaporized.

00:21:07.640 --> 00:21:09.780
It must have been
a dimensional convergence.

00:21:09.780 --> 00:21:10.700
Karasu!

00:21:11.920 --> 00:21:13.200
Stay back!

00:21:14.880 --> 00:21:16.790
Stay away from me, Haruka.

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:18.230
Karasu...

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:25.630
It's all right, Karasu.

00:21:26.030 --> 00:21:27.680
I lose this round.

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:35.670
Make sure you keep
her safe this time, Karasu.

00:21:36.570 --> 00:21:37.950
I'll help out.

00:21:38.410 --> 00:21:39.970
Fukuro...

00:21:44.480 --> 00:21:46.150
Run, Haruka!

00:21:50.520 --> 00:21:52.120
Karasu!

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:53.580
Haruka...

00:21:54.490 --> 00:21:57.050
There is something I want to tell you.

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:00.590
The future...

00:22:01.530 --> 00:22:03.340
The thing about the future, is...

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:10.830
...it never changes.

00:22:11.770 --> 00:22:13.350
Isami!

00:22:13.350 --> 00:22:15.080
Ai...

00:22:15.080 --> 00:22:17.210
I wish I could have seen you again...

00:22:42.640 --> 00:22:44.570
Karasu, hold on!

00:22:45.680 --> 00:22:48.140
Somebody, help us! Please!

00:22:49.610 --> 00:22:51.270
Help Karasu!

00:22:58.050 --> 00:22:58.890
Hey!

00:22:58.890 --> 00:23:01.020
Look! Look over there!

00:23:02.530 --> 00:23:05.230
What is that? Blue snow?

00:23:05.230 --> 00:23:06.360
Snow?

00:23:06.900 --> 00:23:10.410
But that stuff looks like
it's going up, into the sky

00:23:16.110 --> 00:23:18.010
Wh... What's wrong?

00:23:19.140 --> 00:23:22.510
I dunno. I just got sad.

00:23:26.220 --> 00:23:28.910
You're imagining things.
It's nothing.

00:25:12.420 --> 00:25:14.820
I'm dreaming again.

00:25:15.390 --> 00:25:17.190
That summer day's dream.

00:25:18.260 --> 00:25:19.930
Karasu, hold on!

00:25:23.800 --> 00:25:26.350
Hold on tight, everyone!

00:25:29.770 --> 00:25:33.170
There's absolutely no way
our future is laid out for us!

00:25:34.210 --> 00:25:36.270
The next episode: The Wish.

00:25:37.410 --> 00:25:39.970
Please tell him how I feel.
